OL,3,GNEWSACouncil faces cuts after
OL,4,A'startling' #2m overspend
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Essex council has revealed it spent
OL,7,F#2m more than it had budgeted for last
OL,8,Fyear, including for staff on its
OL,9,Fpayroll.
OL,11,FThe budgetary gap still exists for
OL,12,FCastle Point Borough Council - and is
OL,13,Fforecast to be #4.5m for 2026-27.
OL,15,FAngela Hutchings, the authority's chief
OL,16,Fexecutive, told the BBC shortfall was
OL,17,F"startling" and due to reporting errors
OL,18,Fand said an investigation had been
OL,19,Flaunched.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
