OL,3,GNEWSACouncil faces cuts after
OL,4,A'startling' #2m overspend
OL,5,
OL,6,FCastle Point has used reserves - its
OL,7,Fsavings - to cover most of the
OL,8,Foverspend, but now faces making
OL,9,Fsignificant savings, although Hutchings
OL,10,Fsays it is "too early to say" how
OL,11,Fservices will be affected.
